00:02:30.261 --> 00:02:33.480
many popularly finished tools
adopt the ADF on The Grammar of

00:02:33.481 --> 00:02:34.920
Graphics by Lee Wilkinson.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:40.120
The idea is just how
grammar teach us

00:02:40.121 --> 00:02:44.030
how to compose words into
sentences in English grammar for

00:02:44.031 --> 00:02:47.190
graphics provide primitive
building blocks for

00:02:47.191 --> 00:02:49.360
