00:02:58.843 --> 00:03:03.740
Graphical marks, such as bar,
point, area, length,

00:03:03.741 --> 00:03:09.265
the including mapping between
data and property of this marks.

00:03:09.266 --> 00:03:13.674
And scales are function that map
data values from the abstract

00:03:13.675 --> 00:03:17.159
domains to visual values
like pixels or colors.

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:21.972
And finally, guides such as
