00:50:36.648 --> 00:50:39.679
should be, what the default
color should be,

00:50:39.680 --> 00:50:42.030
what the margin should be,
and so.

00:50:43.180 --> 00:50:44.450
&gt;&gt; So the answer is,

00:50:44.451 --> 00:50:46.760
there are ways to allow
Vega to customize plot.

00:50:46.761 --> 00:50:48.770
Even though what we show
