00:52:24.181 --> 00:52:28.044
You can then use Vega and
Vega-Lite more or less,

00:52:28.045 --> 00:52:30.575
as data exchange formats.

00:52:30.576 --> 00:52:35.650
Which is one of the core
design principles behind Vega.

00:52:35.651 --> 00:52:37.440
&gt;&gt; And we know that,
