00:54:12.591 --> 00:54:15.820
Then, it needs some casual
configuration when you

00:54:15.821 --> 00:54:16.630
add things.

00:54:16.631 --> 00:54:18.473
For extensible part,

00:54:18.474 --> 00:54:23.424
one thing that we are adding is
having ability to have macro.

00:54:23.425 --> 00:54:28.630
Like for example, if you think
