00:54:28.631 --> 00:54:30.893
Box plot basically
have the box part,

00:54:30.894 --> 00:54:34.796
which is basically a rectangle,
then you have the line.

00:54:34.797 --> 00:54:39.741
So having the ability to add
macro for even more concise

00:54:39.742 --> 00:54:44.590
syntax, is one thing that
we all ready have support.

00:54:44.591 --> 00:54:46.929
&gt;&gt; Maybe if your question
