behind it, and
augmenting to split it up, and

00:59:00.437 --> 00:59:03.621
dynamically change where certain
operations are taking place.

00:59:03.622 --> 00:59:07.148
But that was before we even
had a declarative form of

00:59:07.149 --> 00:59:09.900
interactions and visualizations.

00:59:09.901 --> 00:59:13.948
Now we have that, so I think
now we can actually go and

00:59:13.949 --> 00:59:18.184
get to that vision and do what
you and I want to do [LAUGH].

00:59:18.185 --> 00:59:21.546
&gt;&gt; So basically, to try to
answer your question a little

00:59:21.547 --> 00:59:24.685
bit more, given a [INAUDIBLE]
you can write program

00:59:24.686 --> 00:59:27.467
that can decouples just
the data for a part.

00:59:27.468 --> 00:59:31.060
And then you can execute
that part on sober.

00:59:31.061 --> 00:59:35.390
But the tricky part will come
when you have interaction.

00:59:35.391 --> 00:59:40.390
So you should only decouple
the part that doesn't involve

00:59:40.391 --> 00:59:41.650
instruction, otherwise,

00:59:41.651 --> 00:59:44.490
it's going to be a lot
of code involved.

00:59:44.491 --> 00:59:47.830
But just, if you I want to
exactly transform part that do

00:59:47.831 --> 00:59:51.170
before you do instruction, you
can extract that to the server.

00:59:51.171 --> 00:59:51.940
And for Vega,

00:59:51.941 --> 00:59:56.720
there's a data flow API that
you can run the data flow of

00:59:56.721 --> 00:59:59.660
Vega without caring about
visual encoding at all.

01:00:00.901 --> 01:00:04.663
&gt;&gt; Or it can be a bit more
nuanced something in between

01:00:04.664 --> 01:00:09.053
those two approaches where you
send some data to the client

01:00:09.054 --> 01:00:13.480
that allows for some limited
set of interactions.

01:00:13.481 --> 01:00:14.880
For example, for
the cross filtering,

01:00:14.881 --> 01:00:17.730
you could send the data
cube to the client.

01:00:17.731 --> 01:00:20.360
But probably not the whole data
cube because it's too large, so

01:00:20.361 --> 01:00:23.400
maybe you restrict it to certain
dimensions of the data cube.

01:00:25.720 --> 01:00:27.573
Yeah, are there
questions around that?

01:00:27.574 --> 01:00:30.943
&gt;&gt; In [INAUDIBLE] you showed the
