associated with the data set?

01:00:37.502 --> 01:00:42.645
&gt;&gt; Yeah, so some [INAUDIBLE]
then we, given the input data,

01:00:42.646 --> 01:00:48.226
we will analyze the schema, and
allow [INAUDIBLE] the schema.

