And the question mark one hard
thing is actually a part of

01:00:51.611 --> 01:00:54.995
another language, that we
built on top of Vega-Lite,

01:00:54.996 --> 01:00:58.034
we don't have time to
demonstrate much about it.

01:00:58.035 --> 01:01:01.212
But basically, so
that's Vega at the lower level,

01:01:01.213 --> 01:01:03.967
that's Vega-Lite that
[INAUDIBLE] to Vega.

01:01:03.968 --> 01:01:07.970
Both Vega and Vega-Lite describe
